      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cambridge%2C_Wisconsin"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The first structure built in the Cambridge area was a dam on the northern part of Koshkonong Creek.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cambridge%2C_Wisconsin"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Koshkonong Creek runs through the center of Cambridge and flows south toward Lake Koshkonong.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
