      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cambridge%2C_Wisconsin"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "During the 1980s and 1990s, Cambridge was known as the salt glaze pottery capital of the world.",
